94773564094_8430499586268792863_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gw7uEzowofEQ7kNvwGk0eqA&_nc_oc=AdpGLThywkPI2Pb-pfU4-ivn0iMT3kfNlMYPNLTcc-VFN3c_UpAYhjlQbC4Azo7_R6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6MyNEUNHj5qTRYyeFCJucgM5JITo4e-Xpj_mpfu521VQ&oe=69FC9ED7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JJ_keyart_landscape_01.png", "id": "895140982980720", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_895140986314053_4158398188561500219_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4g9ziXFRHhUQ7kNvwH_mCxW&_nc_oc=AdoqQM6zp278m8cNOSjaW5RdPWu3tMD_Y0oYUR6dcJTFYHovjhIvQQUOHbinff2jA0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7QQsovBzBXfW7tHoU27h0hyLFbhaxQln5BDEJuuTsPbQ&oe=69FC8C92"}, "display_name": "Jank Jumpers", "keywords": ["climb", "obby", "mountain", "obstacle", "peak"], "long_description": "**Can you reach the top?**\n\nWelcome to **Jank Jumpers, a co-op VR obby** that'll have you making death defying leaps to summit massive floating crags. Team up with friends and work together to discover the path up!\n{732125892790746}\n\n\n# Explore Hidden Routes\nEach level brings new challenges: risky shortcuts, moving hazards, and momentum-based puzzles that reward creativity as much as precision. Discover hangout spots and more secrets along the way.\n{899609659683336}\n\n\n# The Jank Jump\nMaster the Jank Jump and soar to improbable heights and across impossible distances. It will take some practice...\n{697403156562917}\n\n# Reach the top\nMake the climb and the golden idol will be waiting for you at the summit. Earn stars for each crag you complete.\n{4168845696665567}\n\nJump. Jank. Fall. Laugh \u2014 then do it all over again.\n\nSee you at the top.", "short_description": "Jank your way up massive crags"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.luckyjuicebox.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publis